  ('old_prereq_conflict_csci_475', 'requisite', 'CSCI 475 prerequisite: the old course table (p.22) says CSCI 315; the course description (p.42) says CSCI 207. Omar kept the table reading.', 'Old CS bylaw course tables, p.22; course descriptions, p.42', 'Current value: 009 requires CSCI 315 (the table reading).'),
