  ('old_prereq_conflict_csci_221', 'requisite', 'CSCI 221 prerequisite: the old course table (p.20) says PHYS 101 or concurrent; the course description (p.37) says PHYS 101. Omar kept the table reading, but the schema cannot store "or concurrent", so no row is seeded.', 'Old CS bylaw course tables, p.20; course descriptions, p.37', 'Current value: no requisite row in 009.'),
